  <AltText>
    A crude pixel art piece of our friend, Cabbage's OC, Flash Fire, drawn in MS Paint. It is simply their head with a flame coloured mane, red eyes, grey fur (wait, do ponies even have fur?). Next to them is their name, written in katakana as 'フラッシュファイア'.
  </AltText>
  <Description>
    Decided to try and use MS Paint, which we haven't used in forever :3
    And I think Flash Fire turned out quite well.
    No thoughts, just accidental fire ;)
  </Description>
